<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper C · Listening review</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Paper C · Listening review</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><h2>15-minute listening track</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3"></audio><p>Use with questions 1–20. Each of four groups takes 3 minutes 45 seconds. Sources play twice; silence is intentional answer time.</p><a href="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3" download>Download full MP3</a></section><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h2>L1 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-1.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L2 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-2.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L3 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-3.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L4 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-4.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Question-by-question listening review</h2><p>Short single-play clips below omit the long answer silence. Open a transcript only when reviewing.</p><div class="audio-list"><section class="box" id="C1C-M01"><h3>Question 1 · Practising Chinese at home</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m01.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">姐姐的中文很好。每天晚饭后，她陪我练中文。那时妈妈在厨房洗碗，弟弟在客厅看电视，不和我们一起练。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M02"><h3>Question 2 · Visiting Grandmother</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m02.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">奶奶一个人住在南京。明天我和爸爸坐车去看她，妈妈要工作，不能一起去。我们星期天晚上回来。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M03"><h3>Question 3 · Preparing a birthday dinner</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m03.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天是妈妈的生日。我和爸爸买了一个蛋糕，姐姐准备晚饭。妈妈下班回家以后，我们一起给她唱生日歌。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M04"><h3>Question 4 · Where the speaker lives</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m04.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我现在和爸爸妈妈住在天津。哥哥在上海工作，爷爷奶奶住在北京。我们放假的时候常常去北京看他们。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M05"><h3>Question 5 · Monday’s first lesson</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m05.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">星期一上午第一节是数学课，第二节才是中文课。下午有体育课。今天我先把数学书拿出来，中文书还放在书包里。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M06"><h3>Question 6 · Inside the red box</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m06.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">老师，我的橡皮找不到了。</p><p class="cn">黑板旁边的红盒子里有橡皮，你拿一块吧。</p><p class="cn">谢谢，我用完以后放回盒子。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M07"><h3>Question 7 · Where to write answers</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m07.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">老师，今天的答案写在书上吗？</p><p class="cn">不要写在书上，写在本子上。写完以后把本子交给我，书先放在桌子上。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M08"><h3>Question 8 · A book with a name</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m08.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">老师，这本书是谁的？不是我的，我的在书包里。</p><p class="cn">我看看，上面写着小陈的名字。请你下课后把书给小陈。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M09"><h3>Question 9 · Equipment for PE</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m09.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">明天体育课，每人带一瓶水和一条毛巾。不用自己带篮球，学校有。请大家穿运动鞋，准时到操场。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M10"><h3>Question 10 · The end of Chinese class</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m10.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">明天中文课几点下课？</p><p class="cn">八点开始，八点四十结束。休息以后，九点上英语课。</p><p class="cn">好，我八点四十来找你。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M11"><h3>Question 11 · A bowl of soup</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m11.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这碗汤已经凉了，能换一碗热的吗？</p><p class="cn">可以，我给您换热汤。</p><p class="cn">谢谢，天气有点儿冷，我想喝热的。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M12"><h3>Question 12 · Lunch to take home</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m12.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这份午饭在这儿吃吗？</p><p class="cn">不，我要带回家吃。家里还有人在等我。请帮我装好，筷子我家里有，不用给了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M13"><h3>Question 13 · Different fruit preferences</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m13.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">妈妈喜欢吃西瓜，爸爸喜欢苹果。我最喜欢橙子。今天我给他们买西瓜和苹果，也给自己买了几个橙子。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M14"><h3>Question 14 · A complete order price</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m14.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">面条八块，加一个鸡蛋一共多少钱？</p><p class="cn">一共十块。</p><p class="cn">好，我给你十块。</p><p class="cn">谢谢，请在旁边等一下。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M15"><h3>Question 15 · Trying a different size</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m15.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这件小号上衣有点儿小。能试试中号吗？</p><p class="cn">可以，这里有中号和大号。</p><p class="cn">中号正好，我就要中号的。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M16"><h3>Question 16 · Meeting a little earlier</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m16.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我们下午三点见，好吗？</p><p class="cn">我两点半就到了，可以早一点见吗？</p><p class="cn">可以，那我们两点半见，我也早点出门。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M17"><h3>Question 17 · Catching a bus</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m17.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这班车九点开。我们八点半从家里出发，八点四十到车站。到了以后先买票，再一起等车。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M18"><h3>Question 18 · Clothes for an activity</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m18.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">明天学校活动，我们穿什么衣服？</p><p class="cn">白色上衣、黑色裤子。鞋子没有要求。</p><p class="cn">好，我穿黑裤子和蓝色运动鞋。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M19"><h3>Question 19 · What the speaker can do</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m19.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">姐姐很会唱歌，弟弟喜欢画画。我不会唱歌，可是会弹钢琴。周六下午，我们想一起给爸爸妈妈表演。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1C-M20"><h3>Question 20 · Today’s choice</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m20.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天放学后一起去游泳吗？</p><p class="cn">今天我不去游泳，我想在家看书。明天再去游泳。</p><p class="cn">好，那我们明天下午见。</p></details></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Speaking prompts · S1</h2><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h3>S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">你在哪个学校上学？你是哪个班的学生？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">你喜欢什么颜色？喜欢穿什么衣服？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">周末你几点吃午饭？吃完饭做什么？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">星期六一起唱歌，好吗？我们在哪儿见面？</p></details></section></div></main></body></html>